Export Fuse's read map and its tape state, so RG DS Play's companion can read the
Spectrum's memory as its Z80 sees it (Fuse answers retro_get_memory_data with
nothing; 32 pages of 2 KiB, each entry starting with the pointer to its bytes)
and the player can hurry a tape along while a loader reads it (tape_is_playing,
loader_tape_loading from 0002).

--- a/build/link.T
+++ b/build/link.T
@@ -1,4 +1,4 @@
 {
-   global: retro_*;
+   global: retro_*; memory_map_read; tape_is_playing; loader_tape_loading;
    local: *;
 };
